@AIAPI_HostAddress = https://localhost:7007
@Gateway_HostAddress = https://localhost:7010

### Health check
GET {{AIAPI_HostAddress}}/api/ai/tour-assistant/health

### Standard questionnaire (for UI form)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/tour-assistant/questionnaire

### Personalized recommend — foreigner visiting Can Tho
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/tour-assistant/recommend-from-profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companionType": "couple",
  "preferredStartDate": "2026-06-12",
  "preferredEndDate": "2026-06-14",
  "maxBudgetPerPerson": 3500000,
  "hasElderly": false,
  "hasChildren": false,
  "travelInterests": ["river", "culture", "food"],
  "nationalityType": "foreigner",
  "preferredCity": "Can Tho",
  "top": 5,
  "sessionId": "demo-foreigner-cantho"
}

### Personalized recommend — Vietnamese family with elderly + children
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/tour-assistant/recommend-from-profile
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "companionType": "family",
  "preferredStartDate": "2026-07-10",
  "preferredEndDate": "2026-07-15",
  "maxBudgetPerPerson": 6000000,
  "hasElderly": true,
  "elderlyCount": 2,
  "hasChildren": true,
  "childrenCount": 1,
  "travelInterests": ["beach", "relax"],
  "nationalityType": "vietnamese",
  "preferredCity": "Phu Quoc",
  "top": 6
}

### Chat - natural language (via Gateway)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/tour-assistant/chat
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Gợi ý tour biển giá dưới 5 triệu cho 2 người",
  "sessionId": "demo-session-001"
}

### Semantic search
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/tour-assistant/search
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "tour khám phá văn hóa miền Trung 4 ngày",
  "top": 8,
  "maxPrice": 6000000
}

### Consultation with structured criteria
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/tour-assistant/consult
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "city": "Da Lat",
  "durationDays": 3,
  "maxPrice": 5000000,
  "groupSize": 2,
  "travelStyle": "thiên nhiên nghỉ dưỡng",
  "top": 6
}

### Tourism culture insights (authoritative content)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/tour-assistant/tourism?query=dac san van hoa&city=Hoi An&top=5

### Similar tours
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/tour-assistant/recommend/similar/1?top=5

### Evaluation — offline baselines (Admin JWT)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/baselines

POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/run
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "profileCount": 100,
  "topK": 8,
  "randomSeed": 42,
  "includeAlphaSweep": true,
  "labelingMode": "hybrid",
  "includeSignificanceTests": true,
  "exportFormat": "json"
}

### Evaluation — import expert judgments (Admin)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/judgments
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "judgments": [
    {
      "profileSignature": "seed-cantho-river",
      "profileQueryKey": "foreigner_can_tho_couple_river",
      "tourId": 5,
      "relevanceGrade": 3,
      "source": "expert",
      "judgeId": "reviewer-01",
      "notes": "Mekong floating market"
    }
  ]
}

GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/judgments
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### User study — protocol (public)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/user-study/protocol

### User study — scenarios
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/user-study/scenarios

### User study — blind comparison for scenario 0
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/user-study/scenarios/0/comparison?sessionId=participant-demo-001

### User study — submit Likert response
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/user-study/responses
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "assignmentId": 1,
  "sessionId": "participant-demo-001",
  "preferredList": "A",
  "fairnessListA": 6,
  "fairnessListB": 4,
  "satisfactionListA": 6,
  "satisfactionListB": 5,
  "groupFairnessListA": 7,
  "groupFairnessListB": 4,
  "wouldBookListA": 6,
  "wouldBookListB": 5,
  "ageGroup": "25-34",
  "travelExperience": "moderate"
}

### User study — aggregated summary (Admin)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/user-study/summary
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Paper — methodology (public, for writing)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/methodology

### Paper — inter-rater agreement κ
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/inter-rater-agreement
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Paper — seed 40 pilot user study participants (Admin)
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/user-study/seed-pilot
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "participantCount": 40,
  "randomSeed": 42,
  "clearExistingPilot": true
}

### Paper — full bundle export (all tables for Q4 paper)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/evaluation/paper-bundle
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Scoring model spec (paper-ready)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/tour-assistant/scoring-model

### RAG corpus stats (paper Methodology)
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/knowledge/corpus-stats

### RAG semantic retrieval
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/knowledge/rag/search?query=river%20culture%20floating%20market&city=Can%20Tho&interests=river,culture&foreignVisitor=true&top=5

### Multi-source cultural facts
GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/knowledge/facts?city=Hoi%20An&foreignVisitor=true&interests=culture,food

GET {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/training/status
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}

### Admin - retrain ML models
POST {{Gateway_HostAddress}}/api/ai/training/retrain
Authorization: Bearer {{admin_token}}
